<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34728" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνᾰγων-ίζομαι</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιεῦμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.83
				</span></i>
			:—<i>compete</i> in a contest <i>with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.160
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				3.83
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>take part in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡτύχη ἐ. τοῖς τῶν ἀνθρώπων βίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.4.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.85.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναγωνίσασθαι εὐμενῆ τοῖς
			Ἕλλησιν</span> favourable for them <i>to fight in</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.74
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδιὰς ἱππεῦσιν ἐ. ἐπιτή δειος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.63d
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
